# 18. Proxy Quality for Multi-Account Browser Workflows

When managing multiple legitimate browser sessions, proxy selection becomes an infrastructure decision.

A useful model is:

```text id="5qz1ey"
Account
   ↓
Browser Profile
   ↓
Session Data
   ↓
Fingerprint Configuration
   ↓
Proxy
   ↓
