# 22. What Makes a Proxy "Good"?

There is no universally best proxy.

The right proxy depends on the task.

For example:

| Requirement                | Important Proxy Characteristic       |
| -------------------------- | ------------------------------------ |
| General browsing           | Reliability                          |
| Localization testing       | Geographic accuracy                  |
| Account-based workflows    | Stability and appropriate reputation |
| Web research               | Reliability and suitable location    |
| Automation                 | Stability, latency, compatibility    |
| QA testing                 | Repeatability                        |
| Large-scale infrastructure | Availability and manageability       |

The best proxy is the one that fits the actual workflow.

