# 25. CAPTCHAs Should Be Treated as a Measurement

Instead of asking:

> "Which proxy completely removes CAPTCHAs?"

ask:

> "Under controlled conditions, how does this network configuration affect verification frequency and workflow reliability?"

That is a much more useful engineering question.

A simple comparison might look like:

```text id="7y6w3b"
Proxy A
100 Sessions
12 CAPTCHA Events

Proxy B
100 Sessions
7 CAPTCHA Events

Proxy C
100 Sessions
15 CAPTCHA Events
```

This does not prove that Proxy B is universally better.

It only tells you what happened under the specific test conditions.

